	(text "U901: G = 1 + 9.9 k / R901 = 19.93. Reference pin at 50 mV: zero current reads about 1300 codes.\nAMP_RAW can reach 10 V during a range change: R904 and D901 limit the driver input.\nU903: Sallen-Key, 40 kHz, Q = 0.74. R906 and C914 as the converter input needs.\nU904: 3-wire mode, DIN high. CONVST is the I2S word clock, SCLK the bit clock.\nC915 and C916 sit at the REF pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "98311a7f-02e5-57d3-9ebc-405b09cb969b")
	)
